  "story": {
    "day": 42,
    "title": "Kaya's Lunch Break",
    "sentences": [
      "It was Wednesday.",
      "Kaya, a Japanese girl, felt really hungry.",
      "She just finished her P.E. class.",
      "She walked into the school building.",
      "Oh, Kaya saw a new poster inside.",
      "It showed a firefighter and a police officer.",
      "A young man, who was a vet, smiled.",
      "He stood by a short, low table.",
      "A kind lady served hot soup and a small radish.",
      "\"Hey, Mr. Tanaka,\" she said, \"The line is not bad!\"",
      "He replied, \"Uh-huh, it's really fast today.\"",
      "Kaya thought of Paris, or a long trip someday."
    ]
  }
}